### Step 1 - 강사 찾기 시작 (학생 역할)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matching/1/start
Content-Type: application/json

{ "minutes": 5 }

### Step 2 - 강의 신청 (강사 A)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matching/1/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 100 }

### Step 3 - 강의 신청 (강사 B)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matching/1/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 200 }

### Step 4 - 신청 강사 목록 조회 (학생 화면)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matching/1/applicants

### Step 5 - 강사 A 수락 (학생 역할)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matching/1/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 100 }

### Step 6 - 수락 후 목록 재조회 (A=ACCEPTED, B=REJECTED 확인)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matching/1/applicants

### Step 7 - 중복/불가 신청 (400 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matching/1/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 100 }

### Step 8 - 탐색 시간 연장
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matching/1/extend
Content-Type: application/json

{ "minutes": 3 }

### Step 9 - 강사 수업 시작
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matching/tutor/100/start-lesson
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Step 10 - 강사 수업 종료
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matching/tutor/100/end-lesson
Content-Type: application/json

{}